@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@basicCredential = REEMPLAZA_POR_BASE64_DE_USUARIO_Y_CLAVE

### Listar cursos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredential}}

### Consultar curso
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos/1
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredential}}

### Crear curso
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredential}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Seguridad web",
  "horas": 24,
  "categoriaId": 2
}

### Validación 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cursos
Authorization: Basic {{basicCredential}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "",
  "horas": 0,
  "categoriaId": 999999
}
